    "title": "Local Resident Rev. Asturn Bartch Becomes New Homeowner in Shannon Community with Help from Lumbee Tribe Program - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago Rev. Asturn Bartch recently moved into a new three-bedroom home in the Shannon Community before Thanksgiving 2025. He bought the home through the Lumbee Tribe Homeownership program. The program offers a 1% interest rate on loans, which influenced his choice.\nThe Lumbee Tribe also provides a Down Payment Assistance program. Eligible applicants can receive between $10,000 and $20,000. This program is available nationwide to Lumbee Tribe enrolled members. For more details, individuals can contact the Lumbee Tribe Housing Department or visit the tribe's website.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.\n1",
